 child and an ancestral mystery. Using vintage objects, photographs and ephemera, the narrator takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iodOA3I9nHoQ7kNvwFcjh7o&_nc_oc=AdoA51jaPa2Jlq0ybf_CABmfV92IwsqKbOjNklVWJwxn2TF4J7wZJzWdAb-nBvvAvD0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAkIjegDBsZkPI8kM0duw5jkqcVqW3XSFwg_lUCG-VaDA&oe=6A69E181"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P2LM_vSeAC8Q7kNvwHqEWjY&_nc_oc=AdrmNLgFJWxtLLR1HeRB7Eq1QTZuiZtz0h-HKZNRtYuSRT5v-giSvMxGUtv9GLjXUVs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCBwt_quOwUr9ubCX-TMR0aARUrF--pVF-sInzRXvNu_g&oe=6A69EEE6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1aEX2895veMQ7kNvwFeY83L&_nc_oc=Adp3UChSjlsAi8VjBU_FJBF6mWuKFdDoAYXrQgthWrOZBCKdM--3vAFKttBjJlbtBMc&_nc_zt=3